_record_index":"160637","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422120103:0":{"text":"見ても……よいのでしょうか？","source_cn":"我们……可以看看吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFBD91283C7F35826","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"見ても……よいのでしょうか？","female":"見ても……よいのでしょうか？","variant_male_record_index":"160638","variant_female_record_index":"160639","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422120104:0":{"text":"ロワディ様、私、今が一番幸せ……","source_cn":"洛尔迪，我从没有像现在这样幸福过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92EAE620F1FD6003","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422120105:0":{"text":"あなたと過ごす日々は、虹色に輝く泡沫みたいに綺麗で……","source_cn":"和你在一起的每一天，都像生活在巨大的肥皂泡幻影里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F7E5FD8B6187DC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422120106:0":{"text":"自分が卑しい召使いなんかじゃない、って思えるんです。あなたのおかげで、私はちゃんと「私」になれた。","source_cn":"你让我觉得，我不再是卑贱的仆从，被随意驱使的杂役，无足...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x609782F5015597A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422120107:0":{"text":"この広い王都で、ずっと働いてきた。でも……初めて、「自分がいた証」を残せた気がしたんです。あなたの心の中にだけ、ですが……","source_cn":"在这偌大的、我为之不停劳作的王城里，我第一次留下了存在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AE923152A3749DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422120108:0":{"text":"でも、この幸せがいつまで続くんでしょう……私は怖い。","source_cn":"可这样幸福的日子会持续多久呢……？我不敢细想。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4996405288C66AB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422120109:0":{"text":"前に、本当に怖くないのかっておっしゃっていましたよね。本当は怖い、すごく怖い……","source_cn":"你曾经问过我，是否还介意那些阻挡我们的东西？其实我介意...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F95D914CEFE7514","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422120110:0":{"text":"あなたと私は、違う世界に生きています。貴族と恋に落ちた召使いがどうなるのかも、私は分かっている……","source_cn":"我和你生活在不一样的世界里，我比你更清楚那些和贵族恋爱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC16DF5D6C9750ACC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422120111:0":{"text":"でも……後悔はしていません。","source_cn":"但是，我不会后悔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5251A052FDA0CFD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422120112:0":{"text":"ロワディ様、死が二人を分かつその日まで……","source_cn":"洛尔迪，直到死亡把我带走，把我们分开之前……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59DADD6D7606F270","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","do